<template><view class="page"><view class="card"><view class="title">AI 搭配</view><view class="desc">围绕「{{name||"这件商品"}}」从商城在售商品里找搭配。</view><button @click="load">生成搭配</button></view><view v-for="g in groups" :key="g.category" class="group"><view class="group-title">{{g.category}}</view><view v-for="p in g.products" :key="p.id" class="product" @click="open(p.id)"><image :src="p.image" mode="aspectFill"/><view>{{p.store_name}}<text>¥{{p.price}}</text></view></view></view></view></template>
<script>import{sudiAiOutfit}from"@/api/sudi_ai.js";export default{data(){return{name:"",groups:[]}},onLoad(o){this.name=decodeURIComponent(o.name||"")},methods:{async load(){try{const r=await sudiAiOutfit({anchor:this.name||"女装"});this.groups=r&&r.data&&Array.isArray(r.data.groups)?r.data.groups:[]}catch(e){uni.showToast({title:"搭配暂时不可用",icon:"none"})}},open(id){uni.navigateTo({url:"/pages/goods_details/index?id="+id})}}}</script>
<style scoped>.page{padding:28rpx;background:#f7f7f7;min-height:100vh}.card,.group{background:#fff;border-radius:20rpx;padding:26rpx;margin-bottom:20rpx}.title{font-size:36rpx;font-weight:700}.desc{margin:16rpx 0;color:#777;line-height:1.5}button{background:#ff3366;color:#fff;border-radius:999rpx}.group-title{font-weight:700;margin-bottom:14rpx}.product{display:flex;gap:18rpx;margin-top:16rpx;align-items:center}.product image{width:120rpx;height:120rpx;border-radius:12rpx}.product text{display:block;color:#ff3366;margin-top:8rpx}</style>